quuestion.5) Upcasting + Overriding + Variable Hiding
class A {
    int x = 10;

    void show() {
        System.out.println(x);
    }
}

class B extends A {
    int x = 20;

    void show() {
        System.out.println(x);
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        A obj = new B();

        System.out.println(obj.x);

        obj.show();
    }
}
=========================================output======================================
10
20
